---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import storyPhoto from "../assets/images/market-prep.jpg";
---

<section class="section" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="story reveal">
      <Image
        class="story-photo"
        src={storyPhoto}
        alt="Preparing matcha drinks at the Yonsei Matcha market table"
        width={640}
        height={800}
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow-inline">Our Story</div>
        <h2>Fourth generation, one whisk at a time.</h2>
        <div class="tagline">"Kūpuna Kuahā" — Fourth Generation</div>
        <!--
          REPLACE: her story in her own words — what "Yonsei" means to her
          family, how the recipes came from her grandparents, and what she
          wants people to feel when they visit the stand.
        -->
        <p>
          The name “Yonsei Matcha” is inspired by my ʻohana and my roots in
          Hawaiʻi. Following my dad’s restaurant, Sansei, Yonsei represents the
          “next generation” and my place in our family. It also connects to my
          mom’s side, as she is a fourth-generation Japanese American. The name
          reflects my family’s influence and the connection between my Japanese
          heritage, my upbringing in Hawaiʻi, and the business I hope to build.
        </p>
        <p>
          Growing up in Hawaiʻi has shaped the way I approach food, culture, and
          community. With Yonsei Matcha, I enjoy experimenting with matcha,
          exploring local ingredients, and creating flavors inspired by the
          place I call home. We source our matcha from a family farm in Uji,
          Japan, and try to use local ingredients whenever possible to support
          Hawaiʻi’s farmers and small businesses. Sustainability is also a
          priority, from the ingredients we use to the materials we choose for
          our pop-ups. I want Yonsei Matcha to reflect my appreciation for
          Hawaiʻi and the importance of mālama ʻāina while sharing good matcha
          with our community.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .story {
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    }
  }

  .story-photo {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: var(--radius-soft);
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .story .eyebrow-inline {
    font-family: "Quicksand", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal-deep);
  }

  .story h2 {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);
  }

  .story .tagline {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--teal-deep);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .story p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: rgba(24, 24, 24, 0.8);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
</style>
